  "description": "UPnP/SSDP device discovery library for .NET. Sends M-SEARCH requests over UDP multicast (239.255.255.250:1900), streams discovered devices as IObservable<ServiceDescription> via IUPnPSearchService, and parses each device's XML description document into SsdpDescription (FriendlyName, Manufacturer, ModelName, SerialNumber, UDN, Version). ServiceDescription exposes Location, Server, USN, ST, and CacheControl headers from the SSDP HTTP response. Depends on System.Reactive.",
